e attacked","Causes heavy Blight to the paddy when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":800,"def":1500,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"renounced_blemish":{"slug":"renounced_blemish","name":"Renounced Blemish","icon":"/enemies-icons/Renounced Blemish.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A fabric construct that ruthlessly spreads Blight across a wide area. If left unchecked, once fertile farmland will instantly become a farmer's worst nightmare.","abilities":["Absorbs shallow water to attack all allied melee units on the map, dealing splash damage in a cross","When on Blighted tiles, attacks deal additional Arts damage and causes Blight to the paddy"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":600,"def":500,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}},"slumbering_of_sui":{"slug":"slumbering_of_sui","name":"'Slumbering of Sui'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Slumbering of Sui'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Born from the heart of an awakened Feranmut. A thousand years twisted into shadow. The executors of Sui are never alone, for fear is always by their side; to wait in the boundless chaos, or thread the needle in search for a shred of enlightenment?","abilities":["Chaos","Molts after taking a certain amount of damage, causing Blight to the paddies it is on, reducing ATK, DEF, RES, and Weight, while increasing Movement Speed","When HP drops to 0 for the first time, melts into the water and continuously summons enemies; enters the Enlightened State when reborn","Enlightened","Changes attributes, attacks now deal 2 strikes of Physical damage, and becomes i